  "answer": "Play Fest 会在 2026 年 10 月 13 日至 19 日举行,共 7 天。\n\n依据 Google 2026 年 10 月 8 日的公告《Win big at Play Fest: Epic prizes, gaming leagues, and daily deals start October 13》,其中写道\"Google Play is hosting Play Fest… from October 13-19\"。我只看到搜索摘要,没有打开公告原文。\n\n另外有两点容易混淆:\n- Play Pass 会员的双倍积分和加成从 10 月 8 日就开始了,这不算 Play Fest 的举办日期。\n- 买书 15 倍积分只在 10 月 16 日至 18 日。\n\n网址:\n- Google 公告转载(Public/PublicNow):https://ebs.publicnow.com/view/8D8E358B22D225A246556C0B7AEE62AE461B43D5\n- Android Authority 报道:https://www.androidauthority.com/google-play-fest-3718139/\n- Android Central 报道:https://www.androidcentral.com/apps-software/google-pay/google-play-fest-is-coming-to-shower-app-lovers-with-sweepstakes-and-big-discounts",
